{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20198","headline":"谢李輈再到 · 孟郊","name":"谢李輈再到","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"等闲拜日晚，夫妻独相疮。\n况是贤人冤，何必哭飞杨。\n昨夜梦得劒，爲君藏中肠。\n会将当风烹，血染布衣裳。\n劳君又扣门，词句失寻常。\n我不忍出厅，血字湿土墙。\n血字耿不灭，我心惧惶惶。\n会有铿锵夫，见之目生光。\n生光非等闲，君其且安祥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20198.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20198","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}